      "body": "Hi Edna,\n\nI asked you which document bottleneck you would remove, but that was a fairly broad question. For the injury side of your practice, a smaller starting point might make it easier to judge whether AI is genuinely helpful.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould a review-ready summary of medical records or a draft client update save you more time? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
